    "sections": {
        "description": "Craftsman Lite is a modern and professional free WordPress theme designed specifically for carpenters, woodworking professionals, furniture makers, and handyman services. Built with Full Site Editing (FSE) capabilities, this theme gives users complete control over every aspect of their website’s layout and style using WordPress blocks. It comes packed with pre-built block patterns, making it easy to create a visually appealing site without any coding. Craftsman Lite is fast, responsive, SEO-friendly, and perfect for showcasing carpentry portfolios, services, and custom woodworking projects. Whether you're a local carpenter, home renovation expert, or run a furniture workshop, Craftsman Lite helps you build a stunning online presence with ease."
    },
